Package: pindu-launcher
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, glycin-loaders, bubblewrap
Recommends: gamemode
Description: every PC game on your computer in one GNOME library
 Pindu launcher gathers every game on your computer into one library, whichever
 launcher installed it: Steam, Heroic, Lutris, Bottles, Faugus, installed apps and
 games you add yourself. Browse covers, pick up where you left off and start any
 game with one click, or switch to the fullscreen mode and do the same from the
 couch with a controller.
 .
 Windows games run through umu-launcher, which has no Debian package; see
 https://github.com/Open-Wine-Components/umu-launcher#installing
